# qubes-guix-servers: substitute servers qubes-guix-config offers by number.
# Keep yours in ~/.config/qubes-guix/qubes-guix-servers in dom0 (it offers
# to add one there when you type a new URL). "NAME URL" per line; '#'
# starts a comment. Their keys are fetched (URL/signing-key.pub) and shown
# for you to check each time you pick one anew.
#
# home  https://guix-subs.example.org
